@startuml
title 8. Discovery / nearby — cache miss
autonumber
participant Client
participant Gateway
participant Spatial
database Redis
database SpatialDB

Client -> Gateway : GET /spatial/nearby?... (Bearer)
Gateway -> Spatial : forward (validated, X-User-Id set)
Spatial -> Redis : GET key (user-free)
Redis --> Spatial : miss
Spatial -> SpatialDB : ST_DWithin + category IN (...) ORDER BY distance
SpatialDB --> Spatial : rows
Spatial -> Redis : SET key = result (user-free, TTL)
Spatial -> SpatialDB : poi_unlock WHERE user_id = ? AND osm_id = ANY(ids)\n(decoration AFTER the cache, per user)
SpatialDB --> Spatial : unlocked osm_ids of this user
Spatial --> Client : 200 [POIs] (unlocked flag per user)
note right of Spatial : the cached value and its key carry no user data;\nuserId is a separate port argument and never enters the cache unit.
@enduml
